<description>&lt;p&gt;Government forces are massing near opposition leaders' homes while rival groups have seized three towns in southern and central Somalia, expanding the fighting. The government has imposed financial sanctions on the former South West State President and nine others over alleged Al-Shabaab links. Four Pakistani sailors freed from Somali pirates are set to return home, and Somali authorities are screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case. The UN has urged a halt to fighting in Baidoa as famine, displacement and flood risks deepen. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQMXEzQkZkeU1HQmlsNzFDUUhDbnVmbngtbVZGd2tZNGhjaUtzWEZqQ0pvSTF4bW16ZjljbWU2YlBkdl9OVFFJRE5xVXJoVXZCZGI4cl9ubDdrNnlpUXBiUUJLOVdKZ1hRbG52RjAyYWY2VTByS0V5a3BuYzM0dDNpZ0ViT2pNcEZ4dW1ITmFoajNwaW9zNWZLTkxQM3JRcHRwbVdGNXo0cWVEMmZsdk9jdk1xSk9xX1hqS25VTFl2QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNODRacDIweFlsNFdaY2VySjhHTVpYald2bzFwMGluQWwyYzBRTXE2c2FMaG13Z29ROXpQdFd6eThnVk5XTmJCNmt3R3BUeFJhbktLX3pKb2R3RkNsbU4xanNuc1Z4TXhZOXpMUVNhc0oyVDBJMzVhNXN5ZlVwN1FYbmFoYWlCbGJPWG5Ec0h3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMDdRaUdwYnpUZ09hVDdfZlhsbC1ocklGSWJYLW5ROUhBMldkd3pVenZDN25QbzFvTHdCQkVqN3RuWEJQQ2ZuQkh3SmVfaWt1WDNzcmhJYXRQRko3eWdGdlBDT0NGZXV6ajhhNTNpYmlnQnI3cDBVY1VCWkk2Q3JJSHlwN0RZTVY3d2sxSWJSdDlWU3FOWjFpcnRodw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPcVhta2w4UlRHaEVsQXptaThwUVVqY0JQN1d0VW5IYlNkcERWYVJWOTFuRUZLZVhRN21kM1I5QUJ5V1o1eTJncUxWZC1ZWmV